Thank you.

17
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,160
The terrain has changed
for Jotaro and company,

18
00:02:19,420 --> 00:02:21,437
who've entered what
divers across the globe?

19
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,960
call the most beautiful sea in the world.

20
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:26,754
Flanked on the east and west by desert,

21
