its general lack of pollution
and inflowing river water

24
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:38,728
makes it one of the most immaculate
bodies of water on Earth.

25
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:43,857
Hang on a minute.

26
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:46,497
Are you telling me you can
drive this thing, Avdol?

27
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:49,620
It's not a problem
whatsoever, Polnareff. Wow.

28
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,637
And Avdol's not the only one.

29
