Don't even think about it.

30
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:56,197
I refuse to let you put
us through another crash.

31
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:59,037
Well, you sure seem to
be in a foul mood today.

32
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,473
So this is a submarine.

33
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:03,139
