explore the seafloor for pleasure.

38
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:15,178
As you can see, it even has windows.

39
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,476
Whoa, c 'est génial!

40
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:20,277
You know, come to think of it, I've
always sort of liked this kind of thing.

41
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:23,477
Although I wish I could have
ridden in one with a cute girl.

42
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,737
Once again, you haven't
changed, Polnareff.

43
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:29,232
