This sub is amazing.

56
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:05,357
But I guess it is a pleasure
cruiser for the wealthy.

57
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,734
It has a refrigerator,

58
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:11,880
