with the latest in satellite phones.

59
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:13,757
Hey, Kick! I should call.

60
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,937
Would you mind getting me
a drink while you're up?

61
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:17,620
