No, don't.

106
00:06:01,153 --> 00:06:02,337
There's no need for that.

107
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:04,497
I'm positive she'll recover quickly.

108
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:05,410
You're such a worried...

109
