162
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:29,117
Why don't we have some tea?

163
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,620
You will join me for a cup, won't you?

164
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:38,360
Madam Oh please madam Allow me to
serve the tea for you Are you sure?

165
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,640
I'm sorry you have to do that. Truly.

166
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:46,317
But you can rest easy, because
we're right here behind you.

167
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,177
We'll be in Egypt before you know it.

168
