Hey, don't get so carried away.

175
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,497
Believe it or not, the sea has
its fair share of rough terrain.

176
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,698
Yeah, yeah, I know.

177
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:24,804
All right, let's speed
this tub up a little bit.

178
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:29,437
Goldoraf, what are you doing?

179
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,457
It has nothing to do with that.

180
00:09:30,540 --> 00:09:31,775
You gotta believe me.

181
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:41,200
Eww, I'm so tired.

182
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:43,302
