191
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,557
I've just spotted the coast of Africa.

192
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,980
We'll be there soon.

193
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:18,877
Seawater has worn away
the rocks and carved

194
