out an underwater tunnel
near this coral reef.

195
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:26,642
The exit is 200 meters inland, which makes
this the perfect spot for us to surface.

196
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:30,660
At long last, we finally
made it. Wolf, huh?

197
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,037
It took long enough.

198
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,420
So this is Egypt.

199
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,780
It is.

200
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:36,940
We have arrived.

201
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,580
Hmm, what's so funny nothing?

202
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:45,300
I'm just feeling sort of happy is all It's
been quite a while since the five of us.

203
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,616
We're all gathered together like this

204
00:10:56,240 --> 00:11:00,760
Hey, talk you in why'd you
grab six cups for five people?

205
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,540
That's peculiar.

206
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:06,200
I guess I didn't notice I
could have sworn it was five

207
