Impossible! It's a stand!

209
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,842
I don't know how, but it
managed to sneak aboard!

210
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,597
It disappeared! No, it didn't!

211
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,562
It transformed!

212
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:43,640
I'm sure of it.

213
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:47,857
The stand disguised itself as one of the
gauges, just like with the coffee cup.

214
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,500
Come again? Man!

215
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,537
The coral reef is right there!

216
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:54,797
And we were only a few hundred
meters from reaching Egypt!

217
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,917
On the bright side, it looks like Mr.

218
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,997
Joestar was only knocked unconscious.

219
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,680
The problem is his hand.

220
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,360
The phone!

221
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,657
Who'd be calling us at a time like this?

222
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:06,817
Ignore it, Polnareff!

223
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:08,420
We have to stay focused!

224
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,052
It's the High Priestess!

225
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:12,450
Careful!

226
00:12:12,533 --> 00:12:15,457
Our enemy's using a deadly
stand called the High Priestess!

227
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,560
So how do we win?

228
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,080
By knowing the user.

229
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:21,960
The name of this particular
stand user is Rose.

230
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:26,580
She has the ability to control
her stand from far away,

231
