so she's most likely on land.

232
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,840
What's its power?

233
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:34,885
It can turn into almost any inanimate
object, as long as it comes from a mineral.

234
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,281
Plastics, metal, glass, or vinyl.

235
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,442
Its transformations are perfect.

236
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:43,257
There's no way to recognize the
thing until it decides to attack.

237
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:44,260
That's freaky.

238
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:48,128
But how did it sneak aboard the
submarine in the first place?

239
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:54,880
I get it now, so that's how it did it.

240
00:12:55,300 --> 00:12:56,240
How simple.

241
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:58,500
It cut a hole and moseyed on in.

242
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:01,737
