249
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:14,630
Jotaro!

250
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:17,962
Hey, remember anything we
touched might be the...

251
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,560
Hi again, Joseph. It's me.

252
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:25,157
We weren't finished with the
conversation we were having earlier,

253
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,358
so I made Roses give me your number.

254
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,390
Hmm?

255
00:13:31,460 --> 00:13:32,920
Why aren't you speaking?

256
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:36,557
And come to think of it, what's
with all the ruckus over there?

257
